# UNICORE Website Analysis & Gap Assessment
## Analysis of universitycorridors.unhcr.it + Recommendations for Student Support Portal

---

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

The official UNICORE website (universitycorridors.unhcr.it) serves as the **primary application and program information hub**. It effectively handles:
- Application management and admission criteria
- University course listings and information
- Partner organization details
- FAQ for prospective applicants

**Critical Gap:** The website provides **application-stage support only**. Once students arrive in Italy, they lack:
- Real-time financial/payment tracking
- Mental health and wellbeing resources
- Academic support coordination
- Post-graduation pathway guidance
- Alumni networking and career support
- Community building and integration tools

**Solution:** Build complementary **Student & Alumni Support Portal** that extends UNICORE support beyond admission through graduation and career transition.

---

