## SECTION 7: REGISTRATION & LOGIN FLOW

### Current System (universitycorridors.unhcr.it):
```
Anonymous User
    ↓
[Browse public pages]
    ↓
Click "Apply" or "Login"
    ↓
Register Account (if new)
    │
    └─→ Email verification
        ↓
        [Create profile with personal info]
        ↓
        [Provide refugee documentation]
        ↓
        [Upload application documents]
        ↓
        [Dashboard access for tracking]
```

### Proposed Enhanced System (with Student Portal):
```
Prospective Student (Current)
    ↓
[Browse universitycorridors.unhcr.it]
    ↓
Apply via main site
    ↓
[After admission notification]
    ↓
Student/Alumni
    ├─→ Access Support Portal with student login
    ├─→ Create personalized dashboard
    ├─→ Access mental health/academic resources
    ├─→ Join buddy program (if mentor available)
    ├─→ Access job board (graduates)
    └─→ Join alumni network

Alumni
    ├─→ Login to support portal
    ├─→ Update professional profile
    ├─→ Access mentorship opportunities
    ├─→ Participate in alumni events
    ├─→ Browse funding/sponsorship opportunities
    └─→ Share success stories/mentor new students
```

