## CONCLUSION: INTEGRATION FRAMEWORK

### New Portal as **Extension of Official Site**

**Official Site Role:** ✓ Application, Admission, Program Info
**New Portal Role:** ✓ Student Experience, Support, Alumni Engagement

**Together They Provide:**
- Complete UNICORE journey from application through alumni engagement
- Seamless transition between application and student life
- Integrated support from first step to career success
- Transparent program management and outcomes tracking

**Recommended Timeline:**
- **Now (August 2026):** Plan and design new portal
- **September-October 2026:** Develop MVP and core features
- **November 2026:** Soft launch to current students
- **December 2026:** Full public launch
- **2027:** Expand features and capability based on feedback

**Success Metrics:**
- 80%+ of active students use portal monthly
- 4.5/5 average satisfaction rating
- 90%+ of FAQ questions answered satisfactorily
- 50%+ of graduates engaged in alumni network
- Measurable improvements in student outcomes (retention, mental health, employment)

